OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance craned out of
OL,4,Aholiday park after hitting goalpost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wales Air Ambulance helicopter has
OL,7,Fbeen removed from a holiday park by
OL,8,Fcrane after hitting a goalpost.
OL,10,FThe aircraft was lifted out of the Scar
OL,11,FFarm Holiday Park in Saundersfoot,
OL,12,FPembrokeshire, on Sunday and was taken
OL,13,Fto Gloucester by road for repairs.
OL,15,FSpecialist crane and haulage company
OL,16,FN&A James Ltd from Carmarthen, which
OL,17,Fcarried out the recovery operation,
OL,18,Fsaid the aircraft suffered tail damage
OL,19,Fafter hitting a football goal while
OL,20,Flanding.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
